r on that pitch. 10 goals, 6 assists, and 19 tackles won at 48% when you usually run 33%. Those 7 shots on target against Vaine Saxxxx were pure grit. But 3 on-ball actions against ManJustGotTop means you vanished, and 25% shot accuracy against AC KT was wild.\n\nHere's the thing, Grizzly Rips. A bear doesn't climb a tree in one jump. It hugs that trunk and keeps going. Today you climbed a whole division and came within a whisker of another. Twelve points stand between us and Division 2, and I've never been more sure of anything than I am that y'all are gonna go get 'em. Sleep proud, dream big, and come back hungry. Believe!",
